 class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;For-mi-dable; I've already booked my next vacation in Montreuil !&quot; Karen, aged 42</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;Ohlala, that stuff is crazy&quot; Shtrakmag</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is playable with keyboard and USB controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on social networks for exclusive info and glimpses of the game's creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instagram: @woyolejeu</p>", "short_description": "In this French JRPG, you play as Sam, who has just arrived in the Paris suburbs from his hometown in the countryside. Explore this mysterious world, meet strange characters, and face the many enemies that stand in your way.", "supported_languages": "French<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753450/header.jpg?t=1776900447", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776900447", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776900447", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft® Windows® XP / Vista / 7 (32-bit/64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium 4 2.00GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 6100<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft® Windows® XP / Vista / 7 (32-bit/64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium 